#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:37
msgid ""
"Passing an explicit value as the second argument returns it unchanged, "
"including zero or a negative number — validation belongs to the caller. "
"Ratios that scale by `sqrt(annualization)` use this factor directly, so "
"switching frequency changes a Sharpe ratio but never the sign of the mean."
msgstr ""
"把显式数值作为第二个参数传入会原样返回，包括 0 或负数 —— 校验责任在调用方。按 `sqrt(annualization)` "
"缩放的比率直接使用该因子，因此切换频率会改变夏普比率，但不会改变均值的符号。"

