"`sharpe_ratio`, `adjusted_sharpe_ratio`, `sortino_ratio`, `calmar_ratio`, "
"`mar_ratio`, `conditional_sharpe_ratio`, `deflated_sharpe_ratio`, "
"`omega_ratio`"
msgstr "`sharpe_ratio`、`adjusted_sharpe_ratio`、`sortino_ratio`、`calmar_ratio`、`mar_ratio`、`conditional_sharpe_ratio`、`deflated_sharpe_ratio`、`omega_ratio`"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md
msgid "Each has its own deviation divisor and its own degenerate rule"
msgstr "每个都有自己的偏差除数与退化规则"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md
msgid "Tail"
msgstr "尾部"

