"`value_at_risk` family in `metrics/risk.hpp`"
msgstr ""
"`conditional_sharpe_ratio`、`tail_ratio`、`common_sense_ratio`，以及 "
"`metrics/risk.hpp` 中的 `value_at_risk` 系列"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md
msgid "The tail is defined by a cutoff quantile, not by a fixed count"
msgstr "尾部由 cutoff 分位定义，而不是由固定样本数定义"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md
msgid "Benchmark-relative"
msgstr "相对基准"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md
